{
  "version": "v0.35.0",
  "date": "2026-10-20",
  "release_url": "https://github.com/SadPull/LLM-benders-SUC/releases/tag/v0.35.0",
  "changes": [
    "LLM_FIRST_CALL_AT_START: first upper-advice request right after initialization",
    "Codex continuation sends only the dynamic snapshot (prompt_mode=delta)",
    "LLM failures no longer pause the run: one session reset, then LLM disabled and SA continues",
    "Numerical dispatch states (e.g. SUBOPTIMAL) reject the candidate and count dispatch_failures instead of aborting",
    "LLM context drops duplicated fields; marginal cost averages over ON hours",
    "run_experiment.py: DATA_DIR selects data/ or instances/<name>; instances/ adds classic10, rts24, rcuc20",
    "LLM_TRANSPORT='http': streaming SSE Responses transport; non-streaming requests are cut by the relay at about 300 s",
    "LLM output is incremental: only changed units with whole-day ON intervals, rebuilt from the prompt's incumbent_u",
    "Shared JSON output schema for Codex --output-schema and HTTP text.format",
    "Per-candidate validation: invalid candidates are dropped with invalid_reason, fed back to the model; all-invalid replies are NO_VALID_CANDIDATE",
    "result.json llm_history keeps usage, message, accepted, response_model and response_output"
  ],
